0..76 Comment "// The twin of `model/effects/domhringr.gandr`: the laws of its effects that"
77..150 Comment "// sequence one operation after another, which a theory cannot state yet."
151..225 Comment "// Each is written over continuations, an operation taking what runs after"
226..302 Comment "// it, and each binds the value an operation answers with `bind x . …`, an"
303..377 Comment "// abstraction at the continuation\'s port that no rule writes yet (#2115)."
378..449 Comment "// Each law flips to `checks` once that lands. The commutations are the"
450..526 Comment "// table\'s positive rows; a pair the table says does not commute has no law."
